=== Conclusion ===
None of the three num_ctx values (2097152, 8388608, 33554432) produced an
{"error": ...} response from /api/generate on m2b-failed-load-probe (FROM
nemotron3:33b). All three returned {"done":true,"done_reason":"unload",...}
with an empty response and no error field, i.e. Ollama appears to silently
clamp/accept the oversized num_ctx rather than fail to allocate it, at least
for a generate call with an empty prompt and keep_alive:0.
Per Step 1's STOP rule, the search is bounded to these three tries; the Mac
was restored after each try (probe removed, devstral:24b reloaded with
keep_alive:-1) and is confirmed restored at the end (see /api/tags and
/api/ps captured above/below).

